mw5CgUn7pMLhaXXIscfcmXMH6hkNMZAkeicdh9rBzBOuJxITsGEiU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyOt_P2fxy13id5R6pVC722agYA4IVFVoPiIp2rjhLKVA&oe=69B942AE"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175727.png", "id": "1630611974467428", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75411988_1630611977800761_7635821973011666471_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FK1qyOg40UAQ7kNvwF03RW_&_nc_oc=AdmCxtHWjAx4nOWUbbZ0aUpokwrn7Mi_Qn61tjOIJwHRwfpF5jG6BaTyTxDNpd7Kdo4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx0Ug8FpmNOVeGibmN84FLsp5UbHKNL5-4BR3Ogm5pdsw&oe=69B9342E"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175713.png", "id": "549067324527740", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210389_549067327861073_2529266429934636058_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DfHDJRWMPvYQ7kNvwHGW_4q&_nc_oc=Admh4zRMYMClg6c6yoS9oYc-HXZ93xdgnTmpRbnYElsgS_cE9RQGUr749mNiCOsoKxU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyimbed5dao57s2CkpCODn9d6HfMMysPw2KopZfmL83ZA&oe=69B94FFB"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175750.png", "id": "1233285141120740", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974456_1233285144454073_4577451540501517425_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pmPObf8sg_YQ7kNvwHoSL0c&_nc_oc=Admq-7gs24PqvDbUM3xhEbcb-AWaLNP6lIrpBw6wsLPVp3MsLsoEJIBKZUeW6reDNls&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyqj0SoJwSpEZ-gG23KAz0gKSxnwLAwnyPfyMo83InYHA&oe=69B9558F"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175810 (1).png", "id": "1549630812590254", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984460_1549630815923587_3757692530628789073_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oLac2KHkIGIQ7kNvwHedfGz&_nc_oc=Admj-xMxrCMgCHpqFk9QQ-Fm5oXWzWhdrZkFYApB3i-nZm-2bn2MFhjPm1MoSrb3Mwo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxBUzR1zGL6SxpLAFyIJGbEbkSHiLz2TP2yTQd-JyEUJg&oe=69B94DA3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wells Taggers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Overview\nWells Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Gorilla Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer runs out. Runners must avoid being tagged and use the environment and power-ups to outmaneuver the Taggers.\n\nGame Modes:\n\nClassic Tag: Traditional tag mode where Taggers must tag all Runners to win.\nInfected Tag: Tagged players become Taggers, spreading the infection until only one Runner remains.\nFreeze Tag: Tagged players are frozen in place until a teammate unfreezes them. Taggers win by freezing all players.\nMaps:\n\nUrban Playground: Navigate through a bustling cityscape with rooftops, alleys, and parks.\nEnchanted Forest: A magical forest filled with hiding spots and mystical creatures.\nSpace Station: A futuristic environment with zero-gravity zones and space-themed obstacles.\nPower-Ups:\n\n\n", "short_description": "Overview\nWells Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Gorilla Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer."}]}, "developer_name": "Wells_VR", "developer_privacy_policy_ur